{"id":"d6812f594e37d97c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-vl-red.md","title":"van Lambalgen归约与度","display":"df-vl-red — van Lambalgen归约与度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-vl-red","aliases":["43-df-vl-red"],"display":"df-vl-red — van Lambalgen归约与度","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Definition 14.4.1; printed p.396 / PDF p.416","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-vl-red"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-vl-red</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vl-red — van Lambalgen归约与度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 14.4.1; printed p.396 / PDF p.416"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span> 及其等价类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Z)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y\\oplus Z)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Z)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y\\oplus Z)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X,\\qquad X&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\neg(Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X,\\qquad X&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\neg(Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\coloneqq\\{Y\\in2^\\omega:Y\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}X\\},\\qquad\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\coloneqq\\{[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}:X\\in2^\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\coloneqq\\{Y\\in2^\\omega:Y\\equiv_{\\mathrm{vL}}X\\},\\qquad\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\coloneqq\\{[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}:X\\in2^\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\preceq[Y]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[X]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\preceq[Y]_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\iff X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全称量化的是所有辅助序列Z。由逻辑蕴含的自反与传递可得预序，故等价类上的序不依赖代表元。非随机X没有随机直和，因而属于最小度。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Definition 14.4.1; printed p.396 / PDF p.416。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y,Z\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 与 $\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。本节引入 $\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}$、$\\equiv_{\\m